          "letter": "",
          "english": "Mr. Musk is a guy who gets things done. The founder of two tech companies, Tesla Motors and SpaceX, is bringing electric vehicles to mass market and __(26)__ humans to live on other planets. This sounds like so much hot air, but the near $13 billion fortune this entrepreneur has __(27)__ comes from practical achievements rather than hypothetical ones.",
